sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant UI as Next.js Frontend (src/lib/api.ts)
    participant AuthRouter as FastAPI Auth Router (app/routers/auth.py)
    participant Security as Security Core (app/core/security.py)
    participant DB as Database (users, roles, sessions)

    Note over User, DB: --- Registration Flow ---
    User->>UI: Enters email, password, full_name
    UI->>AuthRouter: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    AuthRouter->>Security: hash_password(password) using Argon2id
    Security-->>AuthRouter: password_hash
    AuthRouter->>DB: INSERT INTO users & profiles (role=student)
    AuthRouter-->>UI: 201 Created (User details)

    Note over User, DB: --- Login Flow ---
    User->>UI: Enters email and password
    UI->>AuthRouter: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    AuthRouter->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    AuthRouter->>Security: verify_password(plain, hash)
    Security-->>AuthRouter: True
    AuthRouter->>Security: create_access_token(user_id, role, scopes) [15 min]
    AuthRouter->>Security: create_refresh_token() [14 days]
    AuthRouter->>DB: INSERT INTO sessions (user_id, family_id, token_hash, expires_at)
    AuthRouter-->>UI: JSON {access_token, user} + Set-Cookie: refresh_token (httpOnly, path=/api/v1/auth)
    UI->>UI: Store access_token in memory only

    Note over User, DB: --- Authenticated Request & Auto-Refresh ---
    User->>UI: Performs action (e.g. view roadmap)
    UI->>AuthRouter: GET /api/v1/roadmaps/active (Authorization: Bearer <access_token>)
    alt Access Token Valid
        AuthRouter->>AuthRouter: Verify JWT signature & scopes ("me")
        AuthRouter-->>UI: 200 OK (Roadmap Data)
    else Access Token Expired (401 Unauthorized)
        AuthRouter-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
        UI->>AuthRouter: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (Cookie: refresh_token)
        AuthRouter->>DB: Lookup session by token_hash
        alt Valid Session
            AuthRouter->>DB: Replace session (mark replaced_by, rotate token)
            AuthRouter->>Security: Generate new access & refresh token
            AuthRouter-->>UI: 200 OK {access_token} + Set-Cookie: new refresh_token
            UI->>UI: Update in-memory token
            UI->>AuthRouter: Replay GET /api/v1/roadmaps/active (Bearer <new_token>)
            AuthRouter-->>UI: 200 OK (Roadmap Data)
        else Token Reuse / Invalid Family
            AuthRouter->>DB: Revoke entire family_id chain (Breach Mitigation)
            AuthRouter-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
            UI->>UI: Purge token, redirect to /login
        end
    end
